      "text": "Thanks to the leadership of @Potus, we have secured HUGE WINS on agricultural trade with the EU: \n\n1️⃣ Zero tariffs on dairy, pork, soybean oil, fruits, veggies, tree nuts, seeds, and bison 🦬 \n\n2️⃣ Extended lobster pact 🦞 for our farmers\n\n3️⃣ Streamlined barriers & pork/dairy certs 🐖 🐄\n\n➡️ While there's still more to be done, this is a victory for America's farmers, ranchers, and producers! 🇺🇲",
